<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Arterial Vascular started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Arterial Vascular started.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vector Securities analyst David Gruber on Wednesday said he started coverage of Arterial Vascular Engineering Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the coronary stent maker were unchanged at 16-1/2 in early afternoon.</p>
<p>--Arterial &quot;has garnered a 20-percent market share in Europe despite the presence of large cap cardiovascular device companies,&quot; Gruber said. &quot;A major opportunity exists to penetrate the Japanese and U.S. stent markets dominated by Johnson &amp; Johnson. We believe success in Europe is transferable to other markets.&quot;</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
